      "description": "<ul><li><p>Switching between a weapon attack and an 【⚡Offensive Spell】 grants 1 <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.SpFnResonanceKw1\" data-id=\"SpFnResonanceKw1\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Resonance</a>.</p></li><li><p>Start each conflict with 1 <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.SpFnResonanceKw1\" data-id=\"SpFnResonanceKw1\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Resonance</a>. Max <strong>【SL + 1】</strong> stacks. Lost at the end of the scene.</p></li><li><p>When you cast an 【⚡Offensive Spell】, spend up to <strong>【SL】</strong> <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.SpFnResonanceKw1\" data-id=\"SpFnResonanceKw1\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Resonance</a> for +1 Accuracy each.</p></li></ul>",
